WEBVTT

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:01.931
(Laughter)

00:01:01.931 --> 00:01:03.958
Yes.

00:01:03.958 --> 00:01:06.202
But these things are everywhere.

00:01:06.202 --> 00:01:08.898
They're on sites big, they're on sites small.

00:01:08.898 --> 00:01:11.583
This is a global experience.

00:01:11.583 --> 00:01:14.460
What a 404 page tells you

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:18.617
is that you fell through the cracks.

00:01:18.617 --> 00:01:20.375
And that's not a good experience

00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.819
when you're used to experiences like this.

00:01:22.819 --> 00:01:24.092
You can get on your Kinect

00:01:24.092 --> 00:01:26.250
and you can have unicorns dancing

00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:28.887
and rainbows spraying out of your mobile phone.

00:01:28.887 --> 00:01:30.977
A 404 page is not what you're looking for.